1178227b3 (HEAD -> master) [truetype] Increase precision of font variation (#54371).
 ChangeLog                   | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 include/freetype/freetype.h |  7 +++++++
 src/truetype/ttgload.c      | 62 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------------------
 src/truetype/ttgxvar.c      | 25 +++++++++++++++++++------
